SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2 charge
    pe        4
    Cu        1e-2
    Ba        5e-3

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -formula  CaCO3 1
        -m0       1
        -parms    10 1.0
        -steps   10 100

RATES
    Calcite
    -start
    10 k = PARM(1)
    20 ssa = PARM(2)
    30 rate = k*ssa
    40 moles = rate * TIME
    50 SAVE moles
    -end

USER_PUNCH
    -head Step Time M_Calcite
    10 PUNCH KIN_STEP, KIN_TIME, M
